{
  "id": "HanddrawGojiInkredV1",
  "fps": 30,
  "audio": "handdraw-goji-inkred-v1/audio/narration.mp3",
  "audioLeadFrames": 20,
  "audioDurationSeconds": 50.06,
  "durationInFrames": 1559,
  "durationSeconds": 51.96666666666667,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "night",
      "from": 0,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "熬最深的夜，揉最酸的眼。",
          "startFrame": 21,
          "endFrame": 91
        },
        {
          "text": "日子久了，是不是觉得整个人像褪了色，提不起精神？",
          "startFrame": 102,
          "endFrame": 233
        }
      ],
      "durationInFrames": 244
    },
    {
      "id": "red-twig",
      "from": 244,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "给忙碌的日常，添一抹红吧。",
          "startFrame": 244,
          "endFrame": 317
        },
        {
          "text": "从传统食养，到今天的餐桌，枸杞一直是熟悉的食材。",
          "startFrame": 328,
          "endFrame": 467
        },
        {
          "text": "它含有枸杞多糖和类胡萝卜素。",
          "startFrame": 478,
          "endFrame": 557
        }
      ],
      "durationInFrames": 324
    },
    {
      "id": "detail",
      "from": 568,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "但挑选真材实料，不能只看果蒂的小白点。",
          "startFrame": 568,
          "endFrame": 669
        },
        {
          "text": "单凭外观，可判断不了是不是无硫。",
          "startFrame": 680,
          "endFrame": 768
        }
      ],
      "durationInFrames": 211
    },
    {
      "id": "handfall",
      "from": 779,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "留意果粒是否干爽，有没有异味。",
          "startFrame": 779,
          "endFrame": 858
        },
        {
          "text": "也看看包装标签和检测信息。",
          "startFrame": 869,
          "endFrame": 942
        }
      ],
      "durationInFrames": 174
    },
    {
      "id": "tea",
      "from": 953,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "放进杯里，添上温水。",
          "startFrame": 953,
          "endFrame": 1012
        },
        {
          "text": "看红果慢慢舒展，茶汤渐渐染上一点暖色。",
          "startFrame": 1023,
          "endFrame": 1137
        }
      ],
      "durationInFrames": 195
    },
    {
      "id": "pause",
      "from": 1148,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "食用按包装说明，别忘了让眼睛休息。",
          "startFrame": 1148,
          "endFrame": 1252
        },
        {
          "text": "日常食养，也要配上规律作息。",
          "startFrame": 1263,
          "endFrame": 1339
        }
      ],
      "durationInFrames": 202
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "from": 1350,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "挑选适合自己的好枸杞。",
          "startFrame": 1350,
          "endFrame": 1408
        },
        {
          "text": "给平凡的生活，添一抹温暖的红。",
          "startFrame": 1419,
          "endFrame": 1500
        }
      ],
      "durationInFrames": 209
    }
  ],
